{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/20266ysCC9A6mB1794497902.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>美國股市回軟，三大指數全線低開。</p><p></p><p>道指早段曾跌逾100點。納指低開逾300點，早段落到25,000點邊緣後，跌幅收窄。</p><p></p><p>美國晶片生產商輝達行政總裁黃仁勳辭職。輝達曾經急挫一成四，跌穿150美元後，跌幅收窄至約百分之6。輝達持有股份的CoreWeave，早段下挫一成。</p><p></p><p>晶片商美光科技和閃迪，曾挫百分之5至7。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-12T16:24:26.744908+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":154,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-12T15:37:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-12T22:57:36.372854+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-12T16:17:40.725399+00:00","content_hash":"1e123a11ecd3d1a574b2a42ea578c61c28d482dd5102e6f701ce2db0f34c139b","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-12T16:24:26.744908+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}